# Backend

- Python 3.12, type hints, Ruff-friendly PEP 8.
- Settings via `pydantic-settings` and `.env` (`backend/app/config.py`).
- Routers in `backend/app/api/` are HTTP adapters only. Business logic lives in `ingest/`, `rag/`, `eval/`.
- Raise `HTTPException` with clear status codes. Do not return raw stack traces.
- Log query id, latency, and citation count — not full document text at INFO.
- Tests in `backend/tests/`. Mock Chroma, embedders, and LLM. No network in unit tests.

```python
# ❌ BAD — embedding inside a router
@router.post("/chat")
def chat(q: ChatRequest):
    vec = model.encode(q.query)
    ...

# ✅ GOOD
@router.post("/chat")
def chat(q: ChatRequest, pipeline: Pipeline = Depends(get_pipeline)):
    return pipeline.ask(q.query)
```
